  "required_beats": [
    {
      "id": "91-S4-R1",
      "description": "冬衣靠褥按名目带回小院再认；旧单由此次取物和登记自然引到宝玉，不另空降一宗大案。",
      "status": "PENDING",
      "scope": "CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT",
      "grounding": {
        "seed": {
          "path": "data/prewrite/v06.json",
          "pointer": "/omitted_scene_plans/10/candidate_scenes/3",
          "ref": "data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/10/candidate_scenes/3",
          "sha256": "caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff",
          "text_sha256": "e8e91699c99ca096ed6ac9ba0746aed09ab7e4b39f0c8ad49fb101308033ee2e",
          "value": {
            "id": "91-S4",
            "title": "认旧单从“取物”自然长出"
          }
        },
        "chapter_card_fields": [
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                29083,
                29246
              ],
              "lines": [
                717,
                719
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "464493c8e77fcf3e01f53a96492dd235548be95f574e7651acdcdcbfe9e74ec1"
            },
            "name": "最强处",
            "number": 2,
            "text": "**2｜最强处**  \n准取不是自由回府；雪地、湿鞋、旧府物件重新认领；旧单从取物自然生出；麝月钥匙“今日没什么用”。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                29361,
                29489
              ],
              "lines": [
                723,
                725
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "6cc97a13cccbe3c1ca4ba6a3367927bf54834a3c460b0ed70af9841e0f1b3730"
            },
            "name": "缺失情节",
            "number": 4,
            "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n91-S1凭名目准取；S2物分可取/不可取/无人要；S3拾物先登记；S4旧单带到宝玉。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                29960,
                30094
              ],
              "lines": [
                744,
                746
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "0986195f3b5121029cd0cf22da526cf3e42027a12d567463e7d9095c12087c08"
            },
            "name": "四链",
            "number": 11,
            "text": "**11｜四链**  \nE1：物权/使用权分离。信息：准取通知→进府→登记“玉样物一”→旧单→次日传问。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                30456,
                30669
              ],
              "lines": [
                761,
                764
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "c65a248f72ffd8fbb07ad1ccfe7525f0af07c56b354539ebe051b2f7bb1b2fc6"
            },
            "name": "章法 / 风险",
            "number": 18,
            "text": "**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n准取通知 → 雪中回旧府 → 三类物件 → 凤姐拾物登记 → 旧单引宝玉 → 夜间传话 → 五更出门认单。  \n**风险：**玉线偷锁、文化物过多。\n\n"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "91-S4-R2",
      "description": "夜间传话须让宝玉和家中分别听到由谁传来的有限认单通知，再预备五更出门；宝钗只在家中接话范围参与，贾芸只承接跑腿，不自动成为官面传唤人。",
      "status": "PENDING",
      "scope": "CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT",
